note bottom of LegacyInventoryFacade
  Read-only bridge and lock for explicit opening-balance import into Inventory.
end note
note bottom of LaboratoryRawMaterialsController
  Historical reads remain available.
  Legacy creation POST returns 410; new catalogue belongs to Inventory.
end note
